== How to play ==
^X, ^Y, ^Z: Punches
^A, ^B, ^C: Kicks

^X, ^A: Light Attacks
^Y, ^B: Medium Attacks
^Z, ^C: Heavy Attacks

Hold away from the opponent to block attacks
"Away" can change at any time, so watch out!

_F/_B_+^P_+^P/^K_+^K = Grab
^X_+^A: Roll
^Y_+^B: Power Charge
^Z_+^C: Max Mode or Custom Combo (varies by character)

Use light attacks to get the enemy out of your space
Use medium attacks to poke the enemy at a distance
Use heavy attacks in combos and
to punish the enemy's mistakes

Gain Power naturally by attacking or getting hit
Power is used for EX moves, Super Combos,
and Max Mode/Custom Combo

Common motion inputs:
_QDF
_DSF
_QDB
_HCF
_HCB
~B... _F
~D... _U

Common Super Combo motions:
_QDF_QDF
_QDB_QDB
_HCF_HCF
_HCB_HCB
~B... _F_B_F

More commands will be added later